        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Napkin border of embroidered cotton with coloured silk and metal threads. The silk embroidery filling stitch is double darning on the diagonal with double running in a line for outlines and stems. The metal thread embroidery is worked in double darning and fishbone."@en ;
